Reoteab

Reoteab is an unofficial community-maintained continuation of Coteab.
It is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Noteab or Coteab developers.

Project lineage: Noteab -> Coteab -> Reoteab

This baseline is derived from the complete Coteab v2.2.0 source snapshot.
Coteab credits Vapure (also identified as @criticize. or xVapure), Akito,
ManasAarohi, Matt, spacedev0572, and other contributors in its application
credits. Coteab is based on Noteab.

The Apache License 2.0 and the upstream "Copyright 2025 Noteab" notice are
preserved in LICENSE. Reoteab's README, NOTICE, .gitignore, third-party license
files, and portable-path edits to the inherited developer note were added or
changed for this continuation. No inherited Python, TypeScript, JavaScript,
CSS, JSON runtime data, or compiled frontend behavior was changed in this
baseline replacement.

